dialogs
1	I'm the GRAPHIC ARTIST! Aren't the POKéMON of HOENN interesting?
2	The girl TUBERS, they're cute, hey? To battle against a cute TUBER…Whoop, it's so awesome!And the TWINS! Aren't they cute? A 2-on-2 battle with TWINS…Whoop, it's unbearably fun!
3	Me? You're talking to me? I'm the PROGRAMMER.I wonder what the SLOTS are like here.
4	You never know when and where people will challenge you.That's why I never leave home without my GAME BOY ADVANCE.
5	The sea breeze tickles my heart. It feels wonderful here!
6	SCOTT: … … … … … … … … … … Zzz…… … … … … Huh?! Oh, sorry, sorry! I was snoozing!I came to check out this POKéMON CONTEST thing.I have to admit, it does look quite entertaining, but…Consider me a purist--I prefer battles and tough TRAINERS.But that's just me.PLAYER, I hope you'll enjoy everything like the GYMS, CONTESTS, BATTLE TENT, the whole works!
