scriptdefs
= LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F_EventScript_Scott
lock
faceplayer
goto_if_set FLAG_MET_SCOTT_IN_LILYCOVE LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F_EventScript_MetScott
msgbox	SCOTT: … … … … … … … … … … Zzz…… … … … … Huh?! Oh, sorry, sorry! I was snoozing!I came to check out this POKéMON CONTEST thing.I have to admit, it does look quite entertaining, but…Consider me a purist--I prefer battles and tough TRAINERS.But that's just me.PLAYER, I hope you'll enjoy everything like the GYMS, CONTESTS, BATTLE TENT, the whole works!
addvar VAR_SCOTT_STATE 1
setflag FLAG_MET_SCOTT_IN_LILYCOVE
release
end
= LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F_EventScript_MetScott
msgbox	SCOTT: I think it does take strategy to win a CONTEST.Devising CONTEST strategies is one way of becoming a better TRAINER, I'd say.
release
end
= LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F_EventScript_Woman
msgbox	The sea breeze tickles my heart. It feels wonderful here!
end
= LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F_EventScript_GameBoyKid
msgbox	You never know when and where people will challenge you.That's why I never leave home without my GAME BOY ADVANCE.
end
= LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F_EventScript_Programmer
msgbox	Me? You're talking to me? I'm the PROGRAMMER.I wonder what the SLOTS are like here.
end
= LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F_EventScript_FatMan
msgbox	The girl TUBERS, they're cute, hey? To battle against a cute TUBER…Whoop, it's so awesome!And the TWINS! Aren't they cute? A 2-on-2 battle with TWINS…Whoop, it's unbearably fun!
end
= LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F_EventScript_GraphicArtist
msgbox	I'm the GRAPHIC ARTIST! Aren't the POKéMON of HOENN interesting?
end
= LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F_EventScript_GameDesigner
lock
faceplayer
call_if_unset FLAG_TEMP_2 LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F_EventScript_ShowMeCompletedDex
call_if_set FLAG_TEMP_2 LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F_EventScript_ShowDiploma
specialvar VAR_RESULT HasAllHoennMons
goto_if_eq VAR_RESULT TRUE LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F_EventScript_AllHoennMonsFanfare
release
end
= LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F_EventScript_AllHoennMonsFanfare
setflag FLAG_TEMP_2
playfanfare MUS_OBTAIN_ITEM
waitfanfare
goto LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F_EventScript_ShowDiploma
end
= LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F_EventScript_ShowDiploma
msgbox	Wow! That's awesome! Yep, it's totally awesome!This POKéDEX is completely filled! You really must love POKéMON!I'm so impressed!Let me give you something in recognition of your feat!
waitmessage
call Common_EventScript_PlayGymBadgeFanfare
special Special_ShowDiploma
release
end
= LilycoveCity_CoveLilyMotel_2F_EventScript_ShowMeCompletedDex
msgbox	I'm the GAME DESIGNER.Oh, is that right? You're working on a POKéDEX?It's tough trying to complete it, but don't give up.If you do complete it, please come show me.
return
